@startuml
title Relational Access V1 - L0 System Context
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

actor "Business / Scheduler" as Caller

rectangle "Technical Components" {
  [Idempotent Provider] as Idem
  [Reliable Task Provider] as Task
  [Fencing Provider] as Fence
}

rectangle "Iron Infrastructure" {
  [Storage Routing] as Routing
  [Relational Access] as Access
  [Transaction Component] as Tx
}

rectangle "Application Runtime" {
  [MyBatis Mapper + XML] as Mapper
  [DataSource / SqlSessionTemplate] as Runtime
}

rectangle "Optional Middleware" {
  [ShardingSphere-JDBC] as SSJ
  [ShardingSphere-Proxy] as SSP
}

Caller --> Idem
Caller --> Task
Caller --> Fence
Idem ..> Routing : resolve where
Task ..> Routing : resolve where
Idem --> Access : execute mapper
Task --> Access : execute mapper
Fence --> Access : execute mapper
Access ..> Tx : local transaction
Access --> Mapper
Mapper --> Runtime
Runtime ..> SSJ : logical DataSource mode
Runtime ..> SSP : proxy JDBC mode

note bottom of Access
Does not create pools,
sharding rules, or component SQL.
end note
@enduml
